extends _baseEmail

block content
  p Hi #{firstName},
  p Welcome to Natours! We're really happy to have you with us.
  p Take a moment to complete your profile and add a photo, so your guides know who to look out for on your first tour.
  table(role='presentation' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0')
    tr
      td
        a.btn(href=url target='_blank') Complete your profile
  p
  p If you have any questions about booking a tour, just reply to this email.
  p Happy travels,
    br
    | Nirmalya